      <title>Brakes &amp; Testing Head</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/project/brakes_testing_head/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Jan 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/project/brakes_testing_head/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;role&#34;&gt;Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brakes and Testing Head&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Off-Road Racing Team, NIT Jalandhar&lt;br&gt;
&lt;em&gt;Jan 2017 – May 2019&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;achievements&#34;&gt;Achievements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Built the lightest ATV ever in India&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;BAJA SAE INDIA 2019&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4th Fastest ATV&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;BAJA SAE Illinois 2017&lt;/strong&gt; (international ranking)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;technical-contributions&#34;&gt;Technical Contributions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;brake-system-design&#34;&gt;Brake System Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designed a &lt;strong&gt;Floating Brake Caliper&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Catia V5&lt;/strong&gt; using real-world inputs from &lt;strong&gt;hydraulic pressure sensors&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modeled and assembled brake system for custom suspension geometry and high-speed terrain response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;finite-element-analysis-fea&#34;&gt;Finite Element Analysis (FEA)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimized &lt;strong&gt;brake rotor&lt;/strong&gt; design using &lt;strong&gt;FEA&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated &lt;strong&gt;aluminum&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;SS420 stainless coating&lt;/strong&gt; to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve &lt;strong&gt;cooling capacity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost &lt;strong&gt;hardness and durability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cut brake fade during endurance runs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced brake system weight by &lt;strong&gt;40%&lt;/strong&gt; through a compact assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;validation--testing&#34;&gt;Validation &amp;amp; Testing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validated &lt;strong&gt;braking pedal force&lt;/strong&gt; using a &lt;strong&gt;load cell&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developed a custom test setup using &lt;strong&gt;Arduino Uno&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;LDR sensors&lt;/strong&gt; to measure:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acceleration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Response time&lt;/strong&gt; during brake actuation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
